    "/bbb/v1/search": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "bbbSearch",
        "summary": "Better Business Bureau business search",
        "description": "Pass `next_page` from the previous response; `next_page` is null on the last page.\n\nBusinesses and charities listed by the Better Business Bureau (15 per page, up to 15 pages): BBB rating, accreditation, categories, phone, address, coordinates, service area and the profile URL to pass to /bbb/v1/business and /bbb/v1/reviews. `available_filters` lists the category and state values for this search. Filter by accreditation (`accredited=true`) and BBB rating letter grades (`rating`); `applied_filters` echoes them.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/bbb-search",
        "tags": [
          "BBB"
        ],
        "x-credits": 1,
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "q",
